OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens next with Glasgow
OL,4,ACity Council's pay dispute?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe row over pay and grading at Glasgow
OL,7,FCity Council is proving to be a complex
OL,8,Fand potentially costly one to resolve.
OL,10,FTalks have been taking place again
OL,11,Fbetween the council, the Scottish
OL,12,Fgovernment and the largest council
OL,13,Funion Unison.
OL,15,FBBC Scotland News understands Unison is
OL,16,Fnow considering the latest proposals,
OL,17,Fin a dispute where both sides have
OL,18,Fappeared firmly entrenched.
OL,20,FSo how did we get to this stage, and
OL,21,Fwhat could resolve the issue?
